   Update `handleMomentumScrollEnd` to set `pendingSnapRef.current = true` instead of calling `scrollTo` directly, and update the sync effect to also use `pendingSnapRef` instead of `requestAnimationFrame`. This completes the fix for "on each swiper, it just shows the image i clicked."

